      "role": "user",
      "content": "everything just feels so heavy lately. like i'm just going through the motions of taking care of my dad, but i'm barely even here anymore. it's just this constant, exhausting cycle of watching him fade away and feeling like i'm fading right along with him. i'm so tired of the waiting.",
